\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  Bless Him, Jehovah,\cf0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 My soul and spirit
\par And that can be found within me,
\par Give blessing to His Holy Name
\par Bless Him, Jehovah,
\par My soul and spirit
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2. Reflect his good deeds,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Remember His works.
\par Remember all He does for you;
\par As He forgives you all your sins.
\par For your diseases,
\par He heals all of  them.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3. He redeems your soul
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 out of death's dark vale.
\par With His compassion and His love;
\par He crowns your head with its turban
\par He preserves your growth,
\par And gives you good deeds.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4. He cares for people.
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Who are being cheated.
\par He revealed his ways to Moses;
\par  And perceived the works of Israel
\par He has compassion,
\par And most glorious.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.   Jehovah's judgement
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Comes through His patience;
\par His sympathy is unmeasured,
\par His wrath is not always revealed
\par His wrath has an end,
\par But not eternal.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6.  We, the sons of men,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 We are just like weeds.
\par We are just like the wild flowers;
\par Which look beautiful each morning;
\par But when the wind blows,
\par We are found destroyed.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7.  Jehovah's mansion,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Is built in heaven.
\par His throne is found everlasting.
\par All creation is subjected
\par It is man's duty,
\par To serve Jehovah.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 8\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 8.  Throughout all his works,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 There is perfection.
\par All creatures will ever serve Him,
\par And come before His Holy Throne.
\par My soul and spirit,
\par \pard    Shall serve Jehovah.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

